(6455383, 959285, 114285, '<td valign="top">Perth, great place. I like the lines and I can feel movement, well done, in this. 8</td>', 'Perth, great place. I like the lines and I can feel movement, well done, in this. 8', '2011-06-29 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
