(6455512, 959006, 17513, '<td valign="top">a winner for sure..well done 10/10</td>', 'a winner for sure..well done 10/10', '2011-06-29 03:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455513, 959073, 40391, '<td valign="top">He he.  Im sure I wont be the only one to say this but this is a cheeky entry :-)<br/> <br/>It is quite an interesting pose and the lighting works very well to create an abstract of the human form.  This is the first photo presented to me to vote on and its an excellent example of effective Low Key.  Well done!</td>', 'He he.  Im sure I wont be the only one to say this but this is a cheeky entry :-) It is quite an interesting pose and the lighting works very well to create an abstract of the human form.  This is the first photo presented to me to vote on and its an excellent example of effective Low Key.  Well done!', '2011-06-29 03:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455515, 958743, 40391, '<td valign="top">Simple yet beautiful.</td>', 'Simple yet beautiful.', '2011-06-29 03:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455525, 959285, 60915, '<td valign="top">cool! : )</td>', 'cool! : )', '2011-06-29 03:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455529, 959285, 40391, '<td valign="top">I was in Perth last year and after a big night out on the town (yes  I found some night life) I feel youve captured what I remember.<br/> <br/>As a low key abstract this works quite well for me.  The converging horizontal and vertical lines at 45deg are very intriguing and appealing.  I like!</td>', 'I was in Perth last year and after a big night out on the town (yes  I found some night life) I feel youve captured what I remember. As a low key abstract this works quite well for me.  The converging horizontal and vertical lines at 45deg are very intriguing and appealing.  I like!', '2011-06-29 03:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455538, 959288, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love this type of capture of weather (tried several times myself to get that feeling of force).  In this photo I feel the colour green is slightly too saturated for me.  However, I also dont feel this is a good representation of a low key image with so much light coming from the image.  Keep in mind that my own entry is not doing so well so I may not have the full take on what constitutes a low key shot but I hope my comment was helpful.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love this type of capture of weather (tried several times myself to get that feeling of force).  In this photo I feel the colour green is slightly too saturated for me.  However, I also dont feel this is a good representation of a low key image with so much light coming from the image.  Keep in mind that my own entry is not doing so well so I may not have the full take on what constitutes a low key shot but I hope my comment was helpful.  Good luck.', '2011-06-29 04:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455545, 959138, 40391, '<td valign="top">Now this is great!  The little blown highlights on the rocks add appeal.  The narrow DoF is perfect.  The use of centred composition of your subject breaks the rules in a positive way.  But in this case it is also the title that helps to really make a great image.  Well done!</td>', 'Now this is great!  The little blown highlights on the rocks add appeal.  The narrow DoF is perfect.  The use of centred composition of your subject breaks the rules in a positive way.  But in this case it is also the title that helps to really make a great image.  Well done!', '2011-06-29 04:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455546, 959292, 40391, '<td valign="top">Stunning and beautiful.  There is so much to appreciate in this image.</td>', 'Stunning and beautiful.  There is so much to appreciate in this image.', '2011-06-29 04:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455548, 959321, 29777, '<td valign="top">I think the concept was nice but the execution could be improved. The centered glass makes things static and I''m bothered by the burred text on the glass. I like the black bottle. The only problem I have with it is that the light reflecting on it causes a line that is not a rim light and makes the label appear to extend beyond the apparent outline of the bottle.</td>', 'I think the concept was nice but the execution could be improved. The centered glass makes things static and I''m bothered by the burred text on the glass. I like the black bottle. The only problem I have with it is that the light reflecting on it causes a line that is not a rim light and makes the label appear to extend beyond the apparent outline of the bottle.', '2011-06-29 04:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455549, 959164, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait.  I like the soft focus and grainy feel of this image.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait.  I like the soft focus and grainy feel of this image.', '2011-06-29 04:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455552, 958820, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. What is that in the lower left of the frame, a city? I guess it puts context into the shot, but is distracting at the same time.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. What is that in the lower left of the frame, a city? I guess it puts context into the shot, but is distracting at the same time.', '2011-06-29 04:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455553, 958876, 29777, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the bright dress helps the low key theme. This is a lovely subject and pose. There seems to be a fair bit of noise in the shot.</td>', 'I don''t think the bright dress helps the low key theme. This is a lovely subject and pose. There seems to be a fair bit of noise in the shot.', '2011-06-29 04:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455555, 959104, 29777, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like this type of shot, but I really like the movement in this.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like this type of shot, but I really like the movement in this.', '2011-06-29 04:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455558, 958414, 29777, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would like to know what lens was used for this.</td>', 'Nice. I would like to know what lens was used for this.', '2011-06-29 04:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455559, 959222, 29777, '<td valign="top">how noble</td>', 'how noble', '2011-06-29 04:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455563, 958734, 40391, '<td valign="top">A really wonderful portrait.  Im not getting that low key feeling though from this image.  But I cant score too low such a wonderful capture.  I just wish it was in a different challenge.</td>', 'A really wonderful portrait.  Im not getting that low key feeling though from this image.  But I cant score too low such a wonderful capture.  I just wish it was in a different challenge.', '2011-06-29 04:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
