(6455593, 959321, 40391, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I had the same bottle of Merlot the other night!  Besides that, a very nice photo.</td>', 'Ha!  I had the same bottle of Merlot the other night!  Besides that, a very nice photo.', '2011-06-29 05:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
