(6458429, 958713, 18778, '<td valign="top">The water here reminds me of stars...which I like!  What I''m not sure about is the choice of focus.  The left side of the photo seems sharp and my eye is trying to make the right half do the same.  I like the movement of this shot- &amp; I''m loving the tone.</td>', 'The water here reminds me of stars...which I like!  What I''m not sure about is the choice of focus.  The left side of the photo seems sharp and my eye is trying to make the right half do the same.  I like the movement of this shot- & I''m loving the tone.', '2011-07-02 01:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
