(6458934, 959073, 106233, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! Great work with the light, showing just enough to make a simple, strong, sexy and provocative image. Hope to see it on the front page</td>', 'Fantastic shot! Great work with the light, showing just enough to make a simple, strong, sexy and provocative image. Hope to see it on the front page', '2011-07-02 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
