(6459205, 958596, 59029, '<td valign="top">This shot is just so film noire-ish and interesting...who is this guy, and why is he lighting a match in the dead of night?  Great character you have for a model.  Seeing how little light you had to work with and how sharp your subject is, I can just imagine how still he must have stayed for you! Love it. 9</td>', 'This shot is just so film noire-ish and interesting...who is this guy, and why is he lighting a match in the dead of night?  Great character you have for a model.  Seeing how little light you had to work with and how sharp your subject is, I can just imagine how still he must have stayed for you! Love it. 9', '2011-07-02 22:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
