(6461305, 958039, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is an example of an excellent use of blur. I like the little drops (?) that add a little detail to the image. The composition is also great and nicely balanced.</td>', 'This is an example of an excellent use of blur. I like the little drops (?) that add a little detail to the image. The composition is also great and nicely balanced.', '2011-07-04 20:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
