(6461310, 958611, 132996, '<td valign="top">I like the rich colors you captured here, though I''m not too big on the border...it''s so close to the main object that it creates a little anxiety in the image.</td>', 'I like the rich colors you captured here, though I''m not too big on the border...it''s so close to the main object that it creates a little anxiety in the image.', '2011-07-04 20:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461315, 959193, 132996, '<td valign="top">Amazing abstract. There is definitely a high level of order in the image, though the lines tend to throw me out of the sides. I do love the drops though and slight blue cast.</td>', 'Amazing abstract. There is definitely a high level of order in the image, though the lines tend to throw me out of the sides. I do love the drops though and slight blue cast.', '2011-07-04 20:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461317, 958743, 132996, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture. I love the shadows. I wish we saw the end of the leaf though, it just kind of sinks to the bottom of the image and that''s it...there''s nothing to prompt the viewer to come back.</td>', 'Amazing capture. I love the shadows. I wish we saw the end of the leaf though, it just kind of sinks to the bottom of the image and that''s it...there''s nothing to prompt the viewer to come back.', '2011-07-04 20:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461320, 958375, 132996, '<td valign="top">He has such emotional and deep eyes. You captured them wonderfully here. The low light is very flattering also. I love how you can see each individual hair and on his face, it''s like natural glitter.</td>', 'He has such emotional and deep eyes. You captured them wonderfully here. The low light is very flattering also. I love how you can see each individual hair and on his face, it''s like natural glitter.', '2011-07-04 20:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
