(6461331, 958876, 132996, '<td valign="top">I like the touch of yellow here, but the lighting and composition aren''t very flattering. There are dark circles under her eyes and no catch lights which create a dead, haunted feel. Also, her arm is cut off in a very awkward place on the bottom of the image.</td>', 'I like the touch of yellow here, but the lighting and composition aren''t very flattering. There are dark circles under her eyes and no catch lights which create a dead, haunted feel. Also, her arm is cut off in a very awkward place on the bottom of the image.', '2011-07-04 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
