(6463355, 958926, 115644, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments. Not sure why this was so low. 3 1s, really? Maybe it didn''t meet the low-key definition of some folks. Perhaps the motion of the right hand was bad, but i really wanted to get the motion blur on the sewing machine... oh well.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments. Not sure why this was so low. 3 1s, really? Maybe it didn''t meet the low-key definition of some folks. Perhaps the motion of the right hand was bad, but i really wanted to get the motion blur on the sewing machine... oh well.', '2011-07-06 16:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
