(6463596, 958563, 30982, '<td valign="top">Starting out the month on top again, I see - the luck seems to be holding!  (Or perhaps it is skill and not luck.) :-)  I will say that while I love shots of cats, I don''t necessarily see this as low key.  More of a very well lit and exposed shot of a black cat against black, which in itself is one heck of an accomplishment!  But I am obviously wrong about the low key thing (and didn''t vote because I can''t really tell low key or high key for that matter!) so just ignore my ramblings.  :-)</td>', 'Starting out the month on top again, I see - the luck seems to be holding!  (Or perhaps it is skill and not luck.) :-)  I will say that while I love shots of cats, I don''t necessarily see this as low key.  More of a very well lit and exposed shot of a black cat against black, which in itself is one heck of an accomplishment!  But I am obviously wrong about the low key thing (and didn''t vote because I can''t really tell low key or high key for that matter!) so just ignore my ramblings.  :-)', '2011-07-06 21:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6463616, 959230, 100831, '<td valign="top">wonderful light and composition.</td>', 'wonderful light and composition.', '2011-07-06 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 0),
