(6463999, 958734, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL... It''s interesting that you have this marked for nudity.  I gave it a 7.   Good goin''! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! The first version was. I then cropped to just the face without changing the nude gallery status. I''ll amend.<br/> <br/>Just checked and it isn''t marked as a nude..... interesting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-07 09:52:02.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: LOL... It''s interesting that you have this marked for nudity.  I gave it a 7.   Good goin''!   Ha! The first version was. I then cropped to just the face without changing the nude gallery status. I''ll amend. Just checked and it isn''t marked as a nude..... interesting.', '2011-07-07 10:51:07.000000', '2011-07-07 10:52:02.000000', 0),
