(6464820, 959007, 16106, '<td valign="top">How very lovely this image is. The so so vote is in no way indicative of it''s beauty.</td>', 'How very lovely this image is. The so so vote is in no way indicative of it''s beauty.', '2011-07-08 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466633, 959188, 131284, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all positive comments, I''s especially surprised to receive 3 comments after the challenge had ended giving the image praise. While it scored less than 6 in the end (I thought it would, but it hovered above it for most of the voting so I was living in hope), I''m encouraging and really pleased that a number of people seemed to like the image so much!<br/> <br/>I actually hand held this so I''m quite lucky there''s no shake detectable since it was a 2 second exposure. I''d just gotten off the train when I took this and din''t have a lot of time to set up, so after taking this one and one other as it was pulling away I decided to wait around for the next train to try for a few more shots where I was more prepared, but after 10 minutes of waiting I checked the board and found out I''d have to wait another 1.5 hours to see the next train, so with work in 7 hours I decided against it =).</td>', 'Thanks for all positive comments, I''s especially surprised to receive 3 comments after the challenge had ended giving the image praise. While it scored less than 6 in the end (I thought it would, but it hovered above it for most of the voting so I was living in hope), I''m encouraging and really pleased that a number of people seemed to like the image so much! I actually hand held this so I''m quite lucky there''s no shake detectable since it was a 2 second exposure. I''d just gotten off the train when I took this and din''t have a lot of time to set up, so after taking this one and one other as it was pulling away I decided to wait around for the next train to try for a few more shots where I was more prepared, but after 10 minutes of waiting I checked the board and found out I''d have to wait another 1.5 hours to see the next train, so with work in 7 hours I decided against it =).', '2011-07-10 01:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466650, 959288, 19936, '<td valign="top">I''m running with Denise!</td>', 'I''m running with Denise!', '2011-07-10 02:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466999, 959230, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s mathematically impossible for your commenter avg to be 8.2. That would require at least 5 commenters.</td>', 'It''s mathematically impossible for your commenter avg to be 8.2. That would require at least 5 commenters.', '2011-07-10 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6467003, 959201, 135300, '<td valign="top">Well done, amazingly beautfil.</td>', 'Well done, amazingly beautfil.', '2011-07-10 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6467446, 958596, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, I just realised this is your first ribbon, hooray for you!</td>', 'Oh wow, I just realised this is your first ribbon, hooray for you!', '2011-07-11 01:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6467983, 959054, 105457, '<td valign="top">Hi Brad, greetings from the <b>Critique Club</b>!<br/> <br/>Thanks for reaching out to us, I''ll try and give you my opinion on your photo.<br/> <br/>First impression of the photo is that it''s a bit dark and not entirely focused.<br/>It''s very hard to have a low key image and still maintain the details on your photo.<br/> <br/>The part that hurts the photo more is indeed the focusing. With a f/1.8 lens you could have opened up a bit (I see that it''s f/11), and reduce the ISO. <br/>Of course you could have used the 1 second exposure to try and light up a bit the right-hand side of the photo.<br/> <br/>It''s very hard to focus on such low light, I would have suggested that you took the bird as a focus point and try to get it from there.<br/> <br/>Having said that, I do believe that you capture the high votes from the storytelling that this image provides.<br/>You really touched an important point with the lonely bird, waiting per chance a little boy or girl to come. You really did a great job on the meaning of the photo, and with a little technical aspects you would have conveyed your vision.<br/> <br/>Advice: Direct your viewers to where you want, lighting up the chair and the bird. Keep the photo focused, and increase the contrast a bit. Most of the top places are very contrasty images, almost black and white, little grey. <br/>Keep up your imagination, it was a very well-thought of shot.<br/> <br/>If you need some additional comment, please feel free to contact me.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Joao<br/></td>', 'Hi Brad, greetings from the Critique Club! Thanks for reaching out to us, I''ll try and give you my opinion on your photo. First impression of the photo is that it''s a bit dark and not entirely focused.It''s very hard to have a low key image and still maintain the details on your photo. The part that hurts the photo more is indeed the focusing. With a f/1.8 lens you could have opened up a bit (I see that it''s f/11), and reduce the ISO. Of course you could have used the 1 second exposure to try and light up a bit the right-hand side of the photo. It''s very hard to focus on such low light, I would have suggested that you took the bird as a focus point and try to get it from there. Having said that, I do believe that you capture the high votes from the storytelling that this image provides.You really touched an important point with the lonely bird, waiting per chance a little boy or girl to come. You really did a great job on the meaning of the photo, and with a little technical aspects you would have conveyed your vision. Advice: Direct your viewers to where you want, lighting up the chair and the bird. Keep the photo focused, and increase the contrast a bit. Most of the top places are very contrasty images, almost black and white, little grey. Keep up your imagination, it was a very well-thought of shot. If you need some additional comment, please feel free to contact me. Cheers,Joao', '2011-07-11 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6468716, 958596, 119419, '<td valign="top">Yaaa Birthday Girl, well deserved.</td>', 'Yaaa Birthday Girl, well deserved.', '2011-07-13 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6469879, 958596, 119747, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling to win your first ribbon! Congrats on a fantastic score and picture!</td>', 'I know the feeling to win your first ribbon! Congrats on a fantastic score and picture!', '2011-07-13 20:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6470256, 959188, 117474, '<td valign="top">NICE shot! I think this sored below six becaus of the bright area to the right. Advanced editing might have been able to grab you an extra few tenths maybe? I might have cropped to the corner of the roof, but that''s just me. <br/>Really nice shot again! Unlucky for not breaking six with this one.</td>', 'NICE shot! I think this sored below six becaus of the bright area to the right. Advanced editing might have been able to grab you an extra few tenths maybe? I might have cropped to the corner of the roof, but that''s just me. Really nice shot again! Unlucky for not breaking six with this one.', '2011-07-14 05:43:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6475448, 958398, 12611, '<td valign="top">Again; so perfect, such deep blues and use of light, this is phenomenal and so well done. Deserved more comments, analysis and a ribbon.</td>', 'Again; so perfect, such deep blues and use of light, this is phenomenal and so well done. Deserved more comments, analysis and a ribbon.', '2011-07-19 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477327, 958401, 49683, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10.  I like the feel of it.  The attention to the light and how it drew out the glasses.  The visual gapping was a little off for true symmetry, but that is hard to do without different sized glasses.</td>', 'I gave this a 10.  I like the feel of it.  The attention to the light and how it drew out the glasses.  The visual gapping was a little off for true symmetry, but that is hard to do without different sized glasses.', '2011-07-20 22:49:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6483113, 958563, 43463, '<td valign="top">Late to the party - again...meant to come by earlier and offer congrats on such a great finish Wendy. Absolutely great lighting on this low key pet portrait and love the playful swipe of the claw.</td>', 'Late to the party - again...meant to come by earlier and offer congrats on such a great finish Wendy. Absolutely great lighting on this low key pet portrait and love the playful swipe of the claw.', '2011-07-28 10:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6488044, 958213, 69008, '<td valign="top">You were fortunate to get this little spot of light. I see you used f11 for this. You could have helped get some shutter speed at f5.6 or even 8, and it would have also helped with the noise that you mentioned, though I don''t see it in my monitor. <br/> I love the reflections in the water. The centered composition don''t quite seem to work for me in this one. Cropping bottom and the right side may have shifted things enough to gain a little in scoring.  I''m just sayin'' what I''m seeing, so please don''t be offended.  <br/>Thank you for your thoughtful comment on my (low scoring) image in this challenge.  : )   All comments are appreciated, however, honesty helps more than all the "oohs and ahhhs" to improve my shooting by learning what other people see in my photos.</td>', 'You were fortunate to get this little spot of light. I see you used f11 for this. You could have helped get some shutter speed at f5.6 or even 8, and it would have also helped with the noise that you mentioned, though I don''t see it in my monitor.  I love the reflections in the water. The centered composition don''t quite seem to work for me in this one. Cropping bottom and the right side may have shifted things enough to gain a little in scoring.  I''m just sayin'' what I''m seeing, so please don''t be offended.  Thank you for your thoughtful comment on my (low scoring) image in this challenge.  : )   All comments are appreciated, however, honesty helps more than all the "oohs and ahhhs" to improve my shooting by learning what other people see in my photos.', '2011-08-02 02:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
